This accessor is already a single constant-argument field lookup that the compiler fully inlines; there is no cheaper equivalent that preserves exact behavior, so the body is left unchanged.

```cpp
    FIT_FLOAT32 GetEnhancedAvgAltitude(void) const
    {
        return GetFieldFLOAT32Value(126, 0, FIT_SUBFIELD_INDEX_MAIN_FIELD);
    }
```